    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7807c74dc3f81854f65d4220",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我一次又一次，一次又一次，回想起今天见到\n的景象……她展现出的奔跑，那份强大。\n实在太过震撼――",
      "source_fingerprint": "df492e33ccce75250a4220949e115c60514ab7695e9e0ae17ad6c308e13c8e13",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111310.json",
      "json_path": [
