    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4dbf2606c6b542e1e0ae756",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "尽管如此，我还是勉强……\n启动电脑，动作迟缓地，\n打开了一如往常的云端共享文件夹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "396603e83ca47f394375b03e06c451412b2292853d6c67dcb94b8817feb28e96",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111310.json",
      "json_path": [
